title: Next month
is-hand: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.turn_label = Q.congress ? 'session' : (Q.crisis ? 'week' : 'month');
if (Q.advisor_action_timer <= 0) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription = 'Advisors - an action is available.';
} else if (Q.advisor_action_timer == 1) {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription = 'Advisors - next action available in 1 month.';
} else {
    Q.pinnedCardsDescription = 'Advisors - next action available in ' + Q.advisor_action_timer + ' months.';
}
!}
max-cards: 3

#Here, the main deck will be displayed. Clicking on the deck draws a card into your hand. Clicking on a card activates that card.

[? if crisis : **[+ crisis_name +].** Each action now takes a week. [+ crisis_goal +] ?]

[? if congress : **[+ congress_name +]**, session [+ congress_session +] of [+ congress_sessions +]. At stake: [+ congress_stake +]. We stand with the [+ congress_backing_name +]. ?][? if congress and congress_ahead = 1 : Our side has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the delegates. ?][? if congress and congress_ahead = 0 : The [+ congress_leader_name +] lead with [+ congress_leader_votes +]% of the delegates; our side has [+ congress_votes_for +]%. ?][? if congress and congress_close_call = 1 : It is too close to call. ?]

[? if directive_active and congress = 0 and directive_deadline > 1 : Moscow's directive, *[+ directive_title +]*: [+ directive_deadline +] months left. ?][? if directive_active and congress = 0 and directive_deadline <= 1 : Moscow's directive, *[+ directive_title +]*: due this month. ?]

[? if faction_shift_note : [+ faction_shift_note +] ?]

Party line: **[+ leading_faction_name +]**[? if junior_faction : , with the [+ junior_faction_name +] as junior partner?]. Members in loyal districts: [+ loyal_share_display +]%.

- @crisis_deck
- @congress_deck
- @party
- @movement
- @germany
- @international
- #advisor

@crisis_deck
title: The Crisis
is-deck: true
view-if: crisis = 1 and congress = 0

- #crisis

@congress_deck
title: The Congress
is-deck: true
view-if: congress = 1

- #congress

@party
title: Party Affairs
is-deck: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0

- #party_affairs

@movement
title: The Movement
is-deck: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0

- #movement

@germany
title: Germany
is-deck: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0

- #germany

@international
title: The International
is-deck: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0

- #international
